<Base
  title="48 Hours in Santa Ynez Valley | 48 Hours in California"
  description="A relaxed 48-hour Santa Ynez Valley itinerary through Solvang, Santa Ynez, Los Olivos, vineyard roads, ranch country, and Central Coast wine country."
